# Lead: P2 swept from a pure sine through index 4 rad into feedback grit, at ratio 1 then ratio 3.5.
tempo 100
steps 32
tail 1.5
track lead
param p1 24
param sustain 255
param release 40
sweep p2 0 255 0 15
param p1 232 16
sweep p2 255 0 16 31
note 0 E3 32 127
expect sound 0 32
expect peak_below 0
expect idle 40      # release 40: ~0.9 s to -66 dB
